title: "Supermicro Observability"
abstract: >-
  A loopback-only Prometheus and Grafana monitoring stack for a Supermicro
  X11SPA-TF workstation with two NVIDIA RTX 3090 GPUs, including a persistent
  high-frequency GPU sampler and cached fan-controller metrics.
